Fetch data for THE SYSTEM.CREDIT, THE SYSTEM.DEBIT and THE SYSTEM.BALANCE formulas
The input list looks like this::

    [{
        date_range: {
            range_type: "year"
            year: int
        },
        company_id: int
        codes: str[]
        include_unposted: bool
    }]

